# next-pwa auto-generated service worker + workbox runtime. These files
# are regenerated by `next build` on every Vercel deploy (and every
# local build), so there's no value in tracking them — the committed
# versions drift out of sync on every build, producing phantom
# "uncommitted changes" in ~/.claude/stop-hook-git-check.sh. The
# service worker's behavior is fully driven by next.config.js's
# next-pwa runtime caching rules, which ARE tracked.
public/sw.js
public/sw.js.map
public/workbox-*.js
public/workbox-*.js.map
